{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0313_1000_p", "source_sha256": "12bd1636c5767d12a895715b19a3843896d1093f47bbf3f96a0a3eb00c24fc7e", "ja": "（先日のライブイベント『アイドルマスターズカップ』\nの映像が届いた。早速、鑑賞会がはじまった……）", "zh": "（前些日子举办的现场活动《偶像大师杯》的影像送到了。观赏会马上开始了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0313_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "7427e245859bbc93f3605b4c5c9cd1354a7fd22fa4a4ad842d666629c6eede5a", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nここにいたんですね！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n原来你在这里啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0313_1002_p", "source_sha256": "430ec13dda6edea9f6074b51b1ff1c0113f1717169d451705728c6fbfe53db24", "ja": "あれ、奈緒？\nみんなと、イベントの映像を見てたはずじゃ……。", "zh": "咦，奈绪？\n你刚才应该在和大家一起看活动的录像吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0313_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "9938fae32e5abf6970da8eef7c0d51a3fc561b7d03607601fbb981ef7fb2b093", "ja": "はい！　めっちゃカッコよくて、みんなと一緒に\n「すごい！」って言うてて。それでひらめいたんです！", "zh": "对！超级帅气的，刚才还和大家一起喊“好厉害！”来着。然后我就想到啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0313_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2ae9322e67afebe5f791e2100e2ddb8871ff28fb6755354ad177786097d237b2", "ja": "ひらめいた……？　何をだ？", "zh": "灵光一闪……？想到什么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0313_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "b6281f07d63f5dfa721cdff6cd9b7b61d48a2a6fa59f097281b51e0651638828", "ja": "何って、プロジェクションマッピングですよ！\n劇場の公演でも、毎回使ってみませんか？", "zh": "你问什么？当然是投影映射啦！\n剧场公演也要不要每次都试试看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0313_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "f97a3219067c716261821570bc1d73f02ee4320f3d47d3ca79a1ed71825cb9fd", "ja": "絶対カッコいいライブになると思うんです！\n最新の技術ですからね、使わん手はありません！", "zh": "我觉得绝对会是一场超帅气的演唱会！毕竟是最新技术，不用白不用嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0313_1007_p", "source_sha256": "98c275269cc7f8fe0380c3e6e02985a00cc03e07a0973da70087ec637a300dac", "ja": "なるほど……。確かに、\nファンの人達にも楽しんでもらえそうだ。ただ……。", "zh": "原来如此……确实，\n感觉粉丝们也能乐在其中。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0313_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "e6d6e634afaa834dedf49d3095bee3456f7c91e01bc90286145ccd7c4ebd3931", "ja": "ただ……？", "zh": "不过……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0313_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f1976c40484e4db101e6dd15b21ecb89f74f2767432f6d9e0fda6224cdb57a35", "ja": "ああ。ただ、毎回セットリストに合わせた演出を\n用意するのは、大変かもしれないなと思ってね。", "zh": "嗯。只是，我觉得每次都要根据歌单准备相应的演出，可能会很辛苦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0313_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "c2d71159fcdb78b46ea10051b0f7fe7f5386da78ad97b483321cf2d63fa5105e", "ja": "たしかに……。カッコいい曲の演出が\nかわいいので使えるかっていうと、ちゃいますね……。", "zh": "确实……要说帅气歌曲的演出能不能用在可爱风歌曲上，那还是不太一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0313_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "61a4e9903165eed5bd2eb29ef29fbbcb16e6deb852f7a43944e0b4e914451526", "ja": "曲によって見せたい魅力も違います。\nお笑いのセンスが必要な時やってあるやろうし……。", "zh": "不同的曲子想展现的魅力也不一样。\n需要搞笑感的时候，应该也会有的吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0313_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e31073ce14d2999708b2bc0e98f3700764a7f050fd0414db18ee69ebc2df2585", "ja": "お笑いのセンスは……。ま、まあ。色んなステージを\n見られた方が、来てくれた人も楽しいと思うぞ！", "zh": "说到搞笑的天分……嗯、嗯。能看到各种各样的舞台，来观看的人也会更开心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0313_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "66793596d7f92fcff17f51cf06da11758cf2a2e2d117fc758f6fc20c2b2c2435", "ja": "なるほど。未来と雪歩のボケに、私の華麗なツッコミが\n炸裂する……そんなライブも見てみたいですよね！", "zh": "原来如此。未来和雪步负责装傻，再由我华丽地吐槽……这样的演唱会，我也想看看呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0313_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "df1b6445f87379f12bc3dea22efb38ddd232a28e43ab621f4d995c60e1d82988", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます！\nあやうく自分たちの可能性を狭めるとこでした！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢你！\n险些就要把我们自己的可能性给限制住了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0313_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "bcabdce2a58c534e33ef5efd9ee74edb4201ce5a51586fc57a41c9372409022c", "ja": "ほな、みんなに伝えてきます！　私たちには\nお笑いのセンスがある！　そっちも頑張らなって！", "zh": "那我去告诉大家！我们可是很有搞笑天分的！你们那边也得加把劲才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0313_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7170756380768b98dd77bee31438e98072ab2c189715f9d6bbc1fae088f13c0e", "ja": "ええっ！？\nそこを頑張る必要は……おい、奈緒ーっ！", "zh": "诶诶！？\n没必要在那方面努力吧……喂，奈绪——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
